// Title: Suspicious TSCON Start as SYSTEM
// ID: 9847f263-4a81-424f-970c-875dab15b79b
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2018-03-17
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1219.002
// Description: Detects a tscon.exe start as LOCAL SYSTEM
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((src.process.user containsCIS "AUTHORI" OR src.process.user containsCIS "AUTORI") AND src.process.image.path endswithCIS "\\tscon.exe")
